   "text": "P1 Extract   pdfjs spans -> lines, columns, bold\nP2 Structure  title \u00b7 abstract \u00b7 sections \u00b7 tables\nP3 Locate    reference region\nP4 Segment   entries ([n] / n. / hanging-indent)\nP5 Parse + Verify   fields -> S2/OpenAlex, batch-first\nP6 Link     in-text markers <-> entries, style detect",
